# prefix-block-basic

## Input

```
server.
  host localhost
  port 8080

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..37
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..37
    WORD_KEY@0..7
      WORD@0..7 "server."
    NEWLINE@7..8 "\n"
    SPACE@8..10 "  "
    ENTRY@10..25
      WORD_KEY@10..14
        WORD@10..14 "host"
      SPACE@14..15 " "
      LINE_STRING@15..24
        STRING@15..24 "localhost"
      NEWLINE@24..25 "\n"
    SPACE@25..27 "  "
    ENTRY@27..37
      WORD_KEY@27..31
        WORD@27..31 "port"
      SPACE@31..32 " "
      INTEGER@32..36
        NUMERAL@32..36 "8080"
      NEWLINE@36..37 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        PrefixBlock {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..7 "server.",
            },
            items: [
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@10..14 "host",
                    },
                    value: LineString {
                        string: STRING@15..24 "localhost",
                    },
                },
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@27..31 "port",
                    },
                    value: Integer {
                        sign: none,
                        numeral: NUMERAL@32..36 "8080",
                    },
                },
            ],
        },
    ],
}
```

